    { "type": "text", "id": "fail_note", "x": 900, "y": 1364, "width": 760, "height": 36,
      "text": "The driver will not release a card that is still in use, so a busy GPU makes the suspend\nfail cleanly rather than corrupt the actor. Idle GPUs are the case this supports today.",
